            "text": "To log in to **My Service Canada Account (MSCA)**, use the official Government of Canada page:\n\n**Go to:** Canada.ca \u2192 **My Service Canada Account (MSCA)**  \nUse one of these sign-in options:\n\n- **Interac\u00ae Sign-In Partner** \u2014 sign in with participating online banking credentials  \n- **GCKey** \u2014 Government of Canada username and password  \n- **Provincial sign-in** \u2014 available for **BC** and **Alberta** only  \n\nUse the same sign-in method you used when you registered; it\u2019s tied to your MSCA profile. ([canada.ca](https://www.canada.ca/myservicecanadaaccount?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Important:** Make sure the web address is on **canada.ca** before entering any personal information.",
